        "content": "[No full path to (35,10) yet; stepping toward nearest reachable approach (29, 10) to close distance and reveal map.]\n\n=== JOURNAL ===\nObjective: Descend as deep into the dungeon as you can and survive; ultimately win the game (retrieve the Amulet of Yendor and escape).\n\n=== MAP ===\n\n\n\n\n  ---------------\n  |$............|#\n  |<............|#\n  |.............|#\n  |.............|#\n  |.........$..)|##########  #\n  -----------.--- ### ----|-#@\n             ###### # |.....#d#\n                    ##-....|#\n                      |....|#\n                      |....|#\n                      |.....#\n                      |....|\n                      ------\n\n\n\n\n\n\n=== STATUS ===\nHP: 16/16  AC: 6  Dlvl: 1  Turn: 217  XP: 1  $: 0  Pos: (29,10)\nCharacter: valkyrie (human, neutral)\n\n=== INVENTORY ===\n  b: a +1 long sword (weapon in hand)\n  c: a +0 dagger (alternate weapon; not wielded)\n  d: an uncursed +3 small shield (being worn)\n  e: an uncursed food ration\n\n=== ADJACENT === N=# NE=  E=  SE=# S=d(dog/canine)[PET — don't attack] SW=# W=# NW= \n\n=== HINT === No `>` visible. Nearest way out is an open doorway at (27,11) — `move_to(x=27, y=11)`. (5 exits visible.) [This same suggestion has now been made 3 turns running and the situation has not changed — it is not working. Try a different frontier, a different exit, or `search` for a hidden passage.]\n\n=== VISIBLE FEATURES === stairs UP at (3,6); door (open/gap) at (13,10), (26,10), (27,11) +2 more; weapon at (15,9); gold at (3,5), (12,9)\n\n=== VISIBLE MONSTERS === little dog at (29,11), 1 step S [PET - don't attack]\n\n=== MESSAGES ===\n  As you kick the door, it shatters to pieces!\n\n",
